node_modules/

# `go build` with no -o drops the binary in the repo root; the real
# release artifacts come from `wails build` and live in build/bin/.
/sablewright
/sablewright.exe

*.syso
go.local.mod
go.local.sum

# Regenerated by `wails build` on every run. The bindings aren't imported by
# anything - the frontend reaches the backend through window.go.main.App at
# runtime - and the two build files are stock templates whose every value comes
# from wails.json, so none of it is worth tracking. Un-ignore a file here if it
# ever gets edited by hand.
frontend/wailsjs/
build/windows/info.json
build/windows/wails.exe.manifest
